<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">falcātus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>armed with scythes.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">currus, quadrigae, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					37, 41, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Curt. 4, 9, 4</span></i>; Auct. B. Alex. 75; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 6,
				105</span></i>; <i><span class="en">387</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>sickle-shaped</i>,
				<i>hooked</i>, <i>curved</i>, <i>falcated</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">en sis,</span>”
				<i>a falchion</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 717</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 727</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cauda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 3, 681</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 21, 24, § 47</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinus arcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 229</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
